    fix(sidebar,test): add data-action=new-session to titlebar button (F4)
    
    The previous selector [data-action="workspace-new-session"] targeted the
    hover-revealed button inside sidebar-workspace, which is opacity-0 and
    only rendered once a workspace is already listed — so it was absent in
    fresh/empty sessions. Move the stable assertion to the always-present
    titlebar new-session button and tag it data-action="new-session",
    matching the terse kebab-case convention (prompt-submit, etc.).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

